SUMMARY:Glizzys on the Rivvy
DESCRIPTION:Glizzys on the Rivvy – River Float & Hot Dog Picnic\nGrab your floatie and join SOCYPAA for an afternoon of fun on the Russian River! Spend the day floating with friends\, enjoying hot dogs\, and soaking up the summer at one of Sonoma County’s favorite river spots. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, July 25\nTime: 1:00 PM – 6:00 PM\nMeet Up: 1:30 PM\nLocation: Mothers Beach\n\nWhat to Bring\n\nYour own floatie and pump (BYO)\nCash for a suggested donation of $5–10\nWater\, sunscreen\, and anything else you need for a day on the river\n\nPlease note: Cell service is limited in the area\, so plan accordingly before you arrive. \nThis event is cohosted by MCYPAA and SCCYPAA. Whether you’re coming to float the river\, enjoy a hot dog\, or just spend time in fellowship\, everyone is welcome! \nFor more information\, visit SOCYPAA.org.
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/8895/
LOCATION:Mother’s Beach\, 10584 River Drive\, Forestville\, CA\, 95436\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/unnamed.png
END:VEVENT
