SUMMARY:Treasurers' Forum
DESCRIPTION:SCIF Group Treasurers Forum\nThe SCIF Group Treasurers Forum meets on the fourth Monday of each month at 6:00 p.m.\, immediately before the SCIF General Meeting. \nThis hybrid meeting is open to group treasurers and anyone interested in learning more about AA group finances\, Seventh Tradition responsibilities\, and sharing experience with other trusted servants. \nAttend in person:\nSCIF Meeting Hall \nOr join via Zoom:\nMeeting ID: 860 4370 3384\nPassword: 62
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/treasurers-forum/
LOCATION:SCIF Meeting Hall\, 750 Mendocino Avenue\, Suite 9\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95401\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/forum.png
END:VEVENT
